#: ../../library/zipimport.rst:55
msgid "This module defines an exception:"
msgstr "Tento modul definuje výjimku:"

#: ../../library/zipimport.rst:59
msgid ""
"Exception raised by zipimporter objects. It's a subclass of "
":exc:`ImportError`, so it can be caught as :exc:`ImportError`, too."
msgstr ""
"Výjimka vyvolaná objekty zipimporter. Jedná se o podtřídu "
":exc:`ImportError`, takže ji lze chytit také jako :exc:`ImportError`."

#: ../../library/zipimport.rst:66
msgid "zipimporter Objects"
msgstr "zipimporter objekty"

#: ../../library/zipimport.rst:68
msgid ":class:`zipimporter` is the class for importing ZIP files."
msgstr ":class:`zipimporter` je třída pro import ZIP souborů."

#: ../../library/zipimport.rst:72
msgid ""
"Create a new zipimporter instance. *archivepath* must be a path to a ZIP "
"file, or to a specific path within a ZIP file.  For example, an "
"*archivepath* of :file:`foo/bar.zip/lib` will look for modules in the "
":file:`lib` directory inside the ZIP file :file:`foo/bar.zip` (provided that"
" it exists)."
msgstr ""
"Vytvoří novou instanci zipimporter. *archivepath* musí být cesta k ZIP "
"souboru nebo cesta v rámci ZIP souboru. Například *archivepath* "
":file:`foo/bar.zip/lib` bude hledat moduly v adresáři :file:`lib` v ZIP "
"souboru :file:`foo/bar.zip` (pokud existuje)."

#: ../../library/zipimport.rst:77
msgid ""
":exc:`ZipImportError` is raised if *archivepath* doesn't point to a valid "
"ZIP archive."
msgstr ""
":exc:`ZipImportError` je vyvolana, pokud se *archivepath* nepřípadá na "
"platný ZIP archiv."

#: ../../library/zipimport.rst:82
msgid ""
"Methods ``find_loader()`` and ``find_module()``, deprecated in 3.10 are now "
"removed.  Use :meth:`find_spec` instead."
msgstr ""
"Metody ``find_loader()`` a ``find_module()``, zastaralé ve verzi 3.10, jsou "
"nyní odebrány. Místem nich použijte :meth:`find_spec`."

#: ../../library/zipimport.rst:87
msgid ""
